stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> received
    received --> queued_for_triage : create_case
    queued_for_triage --> triage_running : run_triage starts
    triage_running --> triage_completed : passes all guardrails
    triage_running --> needs_analyst_review : guardrail block or provider failure
    triage_completed --> analyst_feedback_submitted : analyst feedback
    needs_analyst_review --> analyst_feedback_submitted : analyst feedback
    triage_completed --> [*]
    needs_analyst_review --> [*]
    analyst_feedback_submitted --> [*]
    note right of triage_running
      Parallel triage_status: queued to running to
      one of completed, blocked_by_guardrail, needs_review.
    end note
